        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>格林故事《灰姑娘》</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      background: #ffe587;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      padding: 22px;\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Noto Sans CJK SC\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 496px;\n      min-height: 676px;\n      padding: 38px 15px 14px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      background: #fffef0;\n    }\n\n    .illustration {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -1px;\n      left: -2px;\n      width: 94px;\n      height: 83px;\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n\n    .illustration .face {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 10px;\n      left: 45px;\n      width: 25px;\n      height: 25px;\n      border: 1.8px solid #111;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #f7f7e9;\n    }\n\n    .illustration .hair {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 4px;\n      left: 41px;\n      width: 27px;\n      height: 11px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #7091bd;\n      transform: rotate(-28deg);\n    }\n\n    .illustration .cheek {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 20px;\n      left: 67px;\n      width: 23px;\n      height: 24px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #f8d66d;\n    }\n\n    .illustration .neck {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 36px;\n      left: 52px;\n      width: 4px;\n      height: 11px;\n      background: #f3c36d;\n    }\n\n    .illustration .smile {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 32px;\n      left: 25px;\n      width: 28px;\n      height: 18px;\n      border-bottom: 2px solid #e6a735;\n      border-radius: 0 0 50% 50%;\n      transform: rotate(-11deg);\n    }\n\n    .illustration .ribbon {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 21px;\n      left: -7px;\n      width: 27px;\n      height: 8px;\n      background: #7091bd;\n      transform: rotate(-23deg);\n    }\n\n    .illustration .ribbon::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 11px;\n      left: 10px;\n      width: 21px;\n      height: 7px;\n      background: #7091bd;\n      transform: rotate(38deg);\n    }\n\n    .illustration .triangle {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 45px;\n      left: 6px;\n      width: 0;\n      height: 0;\n      border-top: 13px solid transparent;\n      border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;\n      border-left: 17px solid #7091bd;\n      transform: rotate(-20deg);\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 16px;\n      color: #ee7032;\n      font-size: 29px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.25;\n      text-align: center;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      text-align: left;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    p {\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    .page-number {\n      position: absolute;\n      right: 20px;\n      bottom: 8px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"illustration\" aria-label=\"[装饰图案：左上角]\">\n      <div class=\"hair\"></div>\n      <div class=\"face\"></div>\n      <div class=\"cheek\"></div>\n      <div class=\"neck\"></div>\n      <div class=\"smile\"></div>\n      <div class=\"ribbon\"></div>\n      <div class=\"triangle\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h1>格林故事《灰姑娘》</h1>\n\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <p>从前，有一个可爱的小女孩，名叫灰姑娘。她既美丽又善良，对每个人都充满爱心和尊重，不论是她村里的有钱人，还是她家花园里的小老鼠都很喜欢灰姑娘。这是因为灰姑娘有一颗金子般的心，她所遇到的所有人都深爱着她。</p>\n      <p>她和爸爸妈妈住在一个漂亮的大房子，他们一家人一样幸福，直到她母亲不幸去世的那一天。</p>\n      <p>由于担心灰姑娘失去后母亲，她的父亲很快就与村里的一位寡妇再婚，她有两个女儿。她的继母不像灰姑娘的母亲那样温暖和温柔，她的继姐妹也不是很善良，但灰姑娘像她希望他们成为的家人一样爱他们。</p>\n      <p>可悲的是，在婚姻开始后不久，灰姑娘的父亲也去世了，留下她和继母和继姐妹一个人呆着。就在那时，她的新家庭的真实面目显露出来。他们从灰姑娘父母的家里搬走了所有的东西，用他们自己的东西装满了房子。继姐妹们霸占了灰姑娘的卧室，让她睡在地窖里的一堆干草上。继母拿走了灰姑娘的衣服，给她穿破烂的衣服。</p>\n      <p>“如果你想继续住在这里，你必须为此努力，”继母说。</p>\n      <p>一辆马车来接继母和继妹去王宫，灰姑娘跟在外面。</p>\n      <p>“你觉得你要去哪里？” 继母问道。</p>\n      <p>“当然是去皇宫！” 灰姑娘说。</p>\n      <p>“你不能穿着那些丑陋的破烂衣服进宫。” 继母说。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"page-number\">1</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
